# FastAPI conventions

- Pydantic v2 models in `app/schemas/`
- Settings via `get_settings()` in `app/config.py`
- Auth: `Depends(get_current_user)` from `app/deps.py`
- Status codes: 201 create, 204 delete, 404 missing, 401/409 as appropriate
